            "text": "theorem radial_history_eventual (eta : ℝ) {X : ℝ} (hX : 0 < X)\n    (hfar : tailEnd d ≤ Real.log X) :\n    (∫ u in Ioc 0 X, radialH d w.coefficients eta u) = X * radialH d w.coefficients eta X / (1 - d.h)"
